        <gr str="7381">savour</gr>, a sacrifice made by <gr str="801">fire </gr>to the <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="14">And their drink <gr str="5262">offerings </gr>shall be <gr str="2677">half </gr>an <gr str="1969">hin </gr>of <gr str="3196">wine </gr>to a <gr str="6499">bull</gr>, and the <gr str="7992">third </gr>
