        <gr str="1241">young </gr>
        <gr str="6499">bulls</gr>, and <gr str="259">one </gr>
        <gr str="352">ram</gr>, and <gr str="7651">seven </gr>
        <gr str="3532">lambs </gr>of the <gr str="1121">first </gr>
        <gr str="8141">year</gr>: they shall be to you without <gr str="8549">blemish</gr>:</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="20">And their meat <gr str="4503">offering </gr>
