      <VERS vnumber="21">A tenth <gr str="6241">part </gr>shalt thou <gr str="6213">offer </gr>for <gr str="259">every </gr>
        <gr str="3532">lamb</gr>, throughout the <gr str="7651">seven </gr>
        <gr str="3532">lambs</gr>:</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="22">And <gr str="259">one </gr>
        <gr str="8163">goat </gr>
        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">for</STYLE> a sin <gr str="2403">offering</gr>, to make an <gr str="3722">atonement </gr>for you.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="23">Ye shall <gr str="6213">offer </gr>these besides the burnt <gr str="5930">offering </gr>in the <gr str="1242">morning</gr>, which <STYLE css="font-style:italic">is</STYLE> for a <gr str="8548">continual </gr>burnt <gr str="5930">offering</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="24">After this manner ye shall <gr str="6213">offer </gr>
        <gr str="3117">daily</gr>, throughout the <gr str="7651">seven </gr>
