        <gr str="7381">savour </gr>to the <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>: it shall be <gr str="6213">offered </gr>besides the <gr str="8548">continual </gr>burnt <gr str="5930">offering</gr>, and its drink <gr str="5262">offering</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="25">And on the <gr str="7637">seventh </gr>
        <gr str="3117">day </gr>ye shall have an <gr str="6944">holy </gr>
