        <gr str="4399">work</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="26">Also in the <gr str="3117">day </gr>of the <gr str="1061">firstfruits</gr>, when ye <gr str="7126">bring </gr>a <gr str="2319">new </gr>meat <gr str="4503">offering </gr>to the <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>, after your <gr str="7620">weeks </gr>
